WEBVTT

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:04.336
In fact, sleep will actually
future-proof that information

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.716
within the brain,

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.741
cementing those memories

00:01:07.765 --> 00:01:11.236
into the architecture
of those neural networks.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:13.090
And we've begun to discover

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:19.716
exactly how sleep achieves
this memory-consolidation benefit.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.966
The first mechanism
is a file-transfer process.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:27.816
And here, we can speak about
two different structures

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:28.996
within the brain.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.876
The first is called the hippocampus